      "notes": "Multiple targets found including SBTi validated targets for Scope 1, 2, and 3 emissions. All targets have specific quantification except for baseline values which were not explicitly provided in the report. The report mentions achieving a 19% reduction in Scope 1 and 2 GHG emissions in 2023 compared to 2021 levels, but this is a result rather than a target set for 2023. The SBTi validation of targets occurred in 2023. The Scope 3 target specifically applies to 'targeted categories' (Category 1 Purchased Goods and Services) which account for 65% of 2023 Scope 3 emissions.",
