      "notes": "Only one clear sustainability target identified: carbon neutrality by 2040. No specific 2023 targets were explicitly stated in the report. The report shows 2023 performance metrics (e.g., 'Reduced 2.1% year-on-year' for mobility emissions intensity) but these are achievements rather than targets set for 2023. The report describes a 4-level emissions reduction approach with specific metrics for 2023, but these appear to be actual results rather than targets. Target lacks specific quantification for the 2040 goal (no percentage or absolute reduction specified).",
