      "notes": "Sector-wide targets identified rather than specific organizational targets for WorldGBC. The '50% reduction' target corresponds to 'halve emissions by 2030' mentioned in the foreword by the Chair. The 'net zero emissions by 2050' target is referenced in the Asia Pacific Net Zero Readiness Framework section. Both targets lack specific baseline years and values. Multiple targets found but all are sector-wide commitments that WorldGBC is supporting rather than specific organizational targets for WorldGBC itself. Some targets lack specific quantification details.",
