"target_reduction\": \"20% reduction per square metre\", \"target_reduction_scope\": \"Scope 3 emissions from purchased goods and services (Keppel Land)\", \"classification_of_target\": \"Intensity reduction, Science-Based Target (SBTi)\", \"target_year\": \"2030\", \"baseline_year\": \"2020\", \"baseline_value\": null}, {\"target_reduction\": \"Net zero\", \"target_reduction_scope\": \"Scope 1 and Scope 2 emissions (Keppel Data Centres new assets)\", \"classification_of_target\": \"Net-zero target\", \"target_year\": \"2030\", \"baseline_year\": null, \"baseline_value\": null}]",
      "notes": "Multiple targets found across different business units. Quantifiable metrics provided for most targets with specific percentages/absolute values. Interim (2025) and long-term (2030, 2050) targets specified. SBTi validation mentioned for Keppel Land and M1 targets. Baseline years provided for emissions targets (2020) and water/waste (2019). Baseline value provided only for renewable energy assets (2.6 GW at end-2022). Some targets lack baseline values (e.g., electricity consumption). All targets explicitly stated in the 2022 report with clear quantification except where baseline values not specified.",
