      "notes": "Multiple targets found including absolute reduction (25% by 2025), carbon neutrality (2030), intensity reduction (25% per FTE from 2016 baseline by 2030), and net-zero target (2050). The 25% portfolio reduction target lacks baseline year and value. The operational intensity target specifies 2016 baseline but no baseline value. Some targets (like net zero by 2050) are qualitative without specific quantification details. Target for operational emissions (25% per FTE) is tied to 2030 carbon neutrality goal. Unquantified target detected: 'net zero' for portfolio without specific reduction path beyond 2025 milestone.",
