    "strategy": {
      "summary": "JEP's decarbonization strategy for 2024 centers on the TCFD (Task Force on Climate-related Financial Disclosures) framework, with a structured approach to emissions reduction across multiple time horizons. The company has established specific reduction targets for Scope 1 and Scope 2 greenhouse gas emissions across three timeframes: short term (within 3 years), medium term (4 to 6 years), and long term (beyond 6 years). A key operational focus is optimizing production efficiency by analyzing root causes of unplanned stoppages and identifying opportunities for more efficient, higher-quality processes, recognizing that their production operations achieve maximum capacity utilization and minimal unit costs when machines operate at optimal speeds.\n\nTo implement this strategy, JEP has conducted cross-departmental workshops involving management and representatives from all production facilities to identify climate impacts, risks, and opportunities. These workshops informed a high-level assessment of necessary mitigating actions. The company is taking a phased approach to implementing TCFD recommendations across all operational locations, with production facility representatives specifically tasked with sharing experiences and implementing best solutions to address climate impacts. In FY2024, they aligned their disclosures with TCFD recommendations, addressing the four core elements of governance, strategy, risk management, and metrics and targets.\n\nLooking forward, JEP plans to deepen the integration of climate considerations into business strategy and financial planning. This includes incorporating relevant metrics for assessment and qualitative scenario analysis, as well as integrating climate-related risks into the overall risk management framework. The company is enhancing its policy to guide management approach on climate change mitigation, adaptation, and resilience, ensuring implementation across all operational locations while preparing to provide further disclosures in the future.",
      "notes": "Multi-page annual report section found (page 25 of JEP Holdings Ltd. Annual Report 2024). Strategy focuses primarily on operational emissions through TCFD framework adoption. Implementation details provided with specific time-bound targets across short, medium, and long terms. Strategy includes production efficiency optimization as a key operational lever but lacks specific metrics or technologies. Strategy is structured with clear timeframes but remains somewhat high-level in implementation details.",
      "status": null
    },
