      "notes": "All targets extracted from primary source (Sustainability commitments and progress table, page 43) and secondary sources (Science based targets section, page 18; Climate targets section, page 47). Targets include quantifiable metrics with baseline years for emissions, water, and energy intensity. Scope 3 emissions targets differentiated between FLAG and non-FLAG categories per SBTi guidance. Supplier engagement target (10% by 2027) is part of SBTi value chain requirements. Waste target specifies 100% recycling with no baseline year. Some targets lack baseline values (energy intensity, waste, supplier engagement). All SBTi targets submitted in 2022 but awaiting validation (except Scope 3 FLAG target to be submitted in 2023).",
