      "json": "[{\"target_reduction\": \"60% reduction\", \"target_reduction_scope\": \"Operational GHG emissions\", \"classification_of_target\": \"Absolute reduction\", \"target_year\": \"2030\", \"baseline_year\": \"2016-2020\", \"baseline_value\": \"38%\"}, {\"target_reduction\": \"45% reduction\", \"target_reduction_scope\": \"Operational GHG emissions\", \"classification_of_target\": \"Absolute reduction\", \"target_year\": \"2026\", \"baseline_year\": \"2016-2020\", \"baseline_value\": \"38%\"}, {\"target_reduction\": \"43% reduction\", \"target_reduction_scope\": \"Operational GHG emissions\", \"classification_of_target\": \"Absolute reduction\", \"target_year\": \"2023\", \"baseline_year\": \"2016-2020\", \"baseline_value\": \"38%\"}, {\"target_reduction\": \"27.7%\", \"target_reduction_scope\": \"Women in Top and Senior Management\", \"classification_of_target\": \"Percentage target\", \"target_year\": \"2022\", \"baseline_year\": null, \"baseline_value\": null}, {\"target_reduction\": \"RM20 billion\", \"target_reduction_scope\": \"Sustainable financial services\", \"classification_of_target\": \"Financial target\", \"target_year\": \"2026\", \"baseline_year\": null, \"baseline_value\": null}, {\"target_reduction\": \"Over two million\", \"target_reduction_scope\": \"Targeted individuals and businesses across ASEAN\", \"classification_of_target\": \"Numerical target\", \"target_year\": \"2022\", \"baseline_year\": null, \"baseline_value\": null}]",
      "notes": "Multiple targets found with quantifiable metrics. KPI 3 (emissions) has interim targets for 2023, 2026, and 2030 with baseline 2016-2020 (38%). KPI 4 (DEI) has 2022 target of 27.7% women in senior management. KPI 1 (sustainable finance) and KPI 2 (empowerment) have 2026/2022 targets respectively. Target for KPI 2 shows discrepancy between pages (2022 in scorecard vs 2026 in leadership message) - extracted both as explicitly stated. Emissions targets are absolute reductions. Some targets (KPI 1, KPI 2, KPI 4) lack baseline values. Carbon-neutral operations by 2030 is qualitative and excluded per extraction rules.",
