      "notes": "The report mentions commitment to net zero carbon emissions by 2050 and science-based emissions reduction targets to meet the 1.5°C target by 2030. However, specific quantifiable metrics (percentage reduction or absolute values) for these targets are not provided in the images. The report states they are 'among one of the 2,151 organisations in the world that pledge their support for UNGC's Business Ambition for 1.5°C' but lacks specific numerical targets. Current performance metrics are provided (e.g., 0.199 tCO2eq/MWh emissions intensity in 2022, 74% renewable energy in 2022 generation mix), but these are presented as achievements rather than targets. Target lacks specific quantification for the science-based targets and net-zero commitment.",
      "status": null
