      "notes": "Two quantifiable targets found for 2024: (1) Water consumption target for Education Division is 10% reduction from FY2022 baseline (annual 5% reduction target from baseline), (2) Scope 2 emissions target for Education Division is 5% reduction from previous year (2023). Both targets are division-specific (Education Division) as reported in the document. Water target baseline value provided; emissions target baseline year specified but value not provided. Targets are explicitly stated as annual reduction goals in the report.",
