      "notes": "Only one quantified target found that is relevant to 2024 (interim target for 2025). The report states that as of end of 2024, TD achieved 29% reduction in Scope 1 and 2 emissions compared to 2019 baseline (exceeding the 25% target). The long-term net zero target by 2050 was mentioned but excluded as it lacks specific quantification. The 2024 performance shows 115,472 tonnes of CO2e for Scope 1 and 2 emissions, representing a 1.6% year-over-year decline from 2023. The target is aligned with a science-based 1.5°C pathway using SBTi Absolute Contraction Approach.",
