      "notes": "No quantifiable sustainability targets with specific metrics (percentages, absolute values, or baseline information) were found in the provided FY2024 report sections. While the report mentions 'science-based targets' (Image 1: 'our determination to align our corporate strategy with science-based targets remains unwavering') and references a 'FY2025 Sustainability Blueprint' (Image 1), no specific targets with measurable metrics (e.g., percentage reductions, absolute values, baseline years) were disclosed. The ESG metrics linked to management incentives (Image 4) include 'Scope 1 & 2 carbon emission intensity reduction' but lack quantified targets. All observed statements about sustainability goals are qualitative without numerical specifications, making them unextractable per critical extraction rules requiring quantification.",
