      "notes": "No sustainability targets with quantifiable metrics (e.g., percentage reductions, absolute values) explicitly disclosed in the provided images. While asset enhancement initiatives related to sustainability (e.g., chiller replacement for reduced electricity consumption, LEED certifications) are mentioned as operational actions or achievements, there are no stated targets with specific metrics, baselines, or target years for 2024. The document describes sustainability-related activities but does not present formal sustainability targets meeting the extraction criteria (quantified reductions, specific scopes, etc.).",
