      "notes": "No specific quantifiable sustainability targets were found for PT Dian Swastatika Sentosa Tbk in the 2022 Annual Report. The report mentions general commitments to environmental responsibility including: 'Perseroan dan entitas anak berupaya untuk menggunakan material dan energi yang ramah lingkungan dalam mendukung aktivitas bisnis' (the Company and subsidiaries strive to use environmentally friendly materials and energy to support business activities) and mentions preparation for geothermal energy business. The report discusses PLN's (Indonesia's state electricity company) renewable energy targets (51.6% renewable in new power plants by 2030, 23% renewable energy mix by 2025), but these are not the company's own targets. All sustainability-related statements are qualitative without specific metrics, percentages, or absolute values. Unquantified target detected: 'the Indonesian government is committed to supporting the world's zero carbon emissions goal for carbon neutrality by 2060' (government target, not company target).",
