      "summary": "The company's decarbonization strategy in 2022 centers on advancing low-carbon ammonia production as a key pathway for sustainable energy transition, with a focus on measurable GHG reduction and alignment with national climate targets. Central to this approach is the development of 'Blue Ammonia,' an environmentally friendly fuel produced using carbon capture, utilization, and storage (CCSU) technology, which positions Indonesia as a leader in ammonia production while reducing carbon emissions. The strategy integrates operational efficiency improvements, such as achieving 19.05% energy intensity efficiency for ammonia production and 25.00% for LPG, alongside targeted partnerships to refine emissions measurement and reporting frameworks. \n\nSpecific initiatives include signing a Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) with JGC Corporation to measure Greenhouse Gas (GHG) emissions at its ammonia plant from November to December 2022. This collaboration employs advanced technologies like infrared cameras, drones, and satellites to calculate Carbon Intensity (CI) for ammonia products, marking the first practical application of newly developed GHG and CI guidelines. Additionally, the company is piloting co-combustion of Blue Ammonia in existing coal power plants to reduce CO₂ emissions, leveraging its role in the International Maritime Organization’s efforts to cut ship emissions by promoting Blue Ammonia as a cleaner fuel alternative. \n\nSupporting these actions, the company aligns its efforts with Indonesia’s national climate goals, including the unconditional target of reducing carbon emissions by 29% and conditional target of 41% by 2030, alongside long-term strategies for net-zero emissions by 2060. Recognition through the Green PROPER award and the 'Proper Biru' certification underscores its commitment to environmental management, while partnerships like the one with JGC aim to improve industry-wide guidelines for cleaner ammonia production. These interconnected initiatives reflect a structured approach to decarbonization that combines technological innovation, precise emissions tracking, and strategic alignment with global and national sustainability frameworks.",
      "notes": "Multi-page strategy section found; Strategy focuses on Blue Ammonia development, GHG measurement partnerships, and energy efficiency; Specific implementation details provided (MoU, technology use, energy efficiency metrics); Aligns with national climate targets and includes measurable actions",
