      "notes": "Three quantified sustainability targets extracted from Climate Action section (page 156) and CEO letter (page 9). All 2030 targets are SBTi-approved. Scope 1/2 target has 2020 baseline explicitly stated; Scope 3 intensity target (per euro of gross profit) and renewable energy target lack baseline year/value. Climate-neutral 2040 target not extracted as it lacks specific quantification per guidelines. Target metrics prioritized for exact quantification per extraction rules.",
