      "notes": "The company committed to developing science-based emissions reduction targets (SBTi) in 2022, but specific targets were not yet defined. The company signed a Memorandum of Understanding on November 17, 2022 to develop a roadmap for emission reduction targets to achieve Net Zero with the SBTi framework. On April 10, 2023, the company signed the SBTi Commitment Letter to develop 'near-term science-based emissions reduction targets' within 24 months. The quantifiable target identified is the CO2 avoidance from renewable energy installations (1,390,000 kg CO2 annually) once completed in 2023. The company installed a rooftop solar power system in Gandaria City (544.46 KWp) targeted for May 2023 operation, with additional installations at Tunjungan Plaza (104.64 KWp), Royal Plaza (800 KWp), and Pakuwon Mall Jogja (206.1 KWp) targeted for completion in the second half of 2023. The total capacity of 1,655 KWp will enable the annual CO2 avoidance.",
