      "notes": "One quantifiable sustainability target found for 2022 reporting period: 23.9% reduction in Scope 2 CO₂ emission intensity by 2030. The company mentions using solar panels with 580 MW capacity to cover approximately 30% of electricity needs as part of this target implementation. The company has committed to declaring decarbonization targets through SBTi with 'Committed' status but specific targets not detailed in the provided documents. Target lacks baseline year and value specification. No specific 2022 targets (as opposed to targets to be achieved by 2022) were explicitly stated, only targets that were in place during 2022 reporting period.",
