      "notes": "Multiple targets found: Two key targets were specifically set in May 2023 - medium-term reduction targets for Scope 1 and 2 emissions (40% by 2025, 55% by 2026) and reduction targets for steel and transport sectors. Additional long-term net zero targets were also referenced (2030 for Scope 1 & 2, 2050 for Scope 3). The 2023 targets were set but no specific 2023 achievement targets were identified. Some targets lack specific quantification and baseline values. The company follows NZBA (Net-Zero Banking Alliance) framework for setting sector-specific targets.",
      "status": null
