      "notes": "No specific sustainability targets for 2024 were explicitly stated in the provided images. While the report mentions that PT Pakuwon Jati Tbk became the first real estate company in Indonesia to have its building sector targets validated by SBTi (using SDA approach), and references net-zero commitment, no quantifiable targets (percentages, absolute reductions, baseline years/values) for 2024 or future years were provided in the visible text. The only numerical data found (1,258.21 Ton CO2eq/year GHG reduction) appears to be an achievement in December 2024 rather than a target. The section stating 'The following are the Company's targets...' (page 106) is incomplete in the provided image. All reported metrics (solar capacity, electricity generation) describe current achievements, not targets. Unquantified target detected: 'net zero emissions' commitment without specific metrics.",
