      "notes": "The company received SBTi validation in early 2024 for GHG emission reduction targets aligned with 1.5°C goal. While the company has committed to reduce absolute Scope 1 and 2 GHG emissions by 50.4% until 2032 and Scope 3 emissions by 30% by 2032, these are not 2024 targets. The only specific 2024 target identified is the installation of SPV phase 2 of 2.7 MWp, which is noted to be constrained by regulatory changes. No quantified emission reduction targets specifically for 2024 were disclosed.",
