      "summary": "The company's decarbonization strategy for 2024 centers on nature-based solutions, particularly an extensive tree planting program, as a core component of its emission reduction approach. The company recognizes its operational activities contribute to greenhouse gas emissions and has committed to reducing emissions as part of its social and environmental responsibility. This strategy views tree planting as both a strategic step in absorbing greenhouse gas emissions and a tangible contribution to global climate change efforts. The approach integrates tree planting with energy efficiency programs as part of a comprehensive emission reduction strategy that supports environmental sustainability and future generations.\n\nIn 2024, the company implemented a comprehensive tree planting initiative that included planting 10,694 trees across more than 90 different species. The program strategically selects tree varieties based on their specific environmental benefits: shade trees such as Samanea saman, Alstonia scholaris, and Swietenia macrophylla for carbon absorption and air quality improvement; flowering trees like Tabebuia rosea, Delonix regia, Jacaranda mimosifolia, and Cassia fistula to enhance visual appeal and attract pollinators; and fruit and utility trees including Mangifera indica, Psidium guajava, Cocos nucifera, Moringa oleifera, and Coffea robusta to add ecological and social value. This diverse planting strategy resulted in 4,277.60 TonCO₂ of emission absorption in 2024.\n\nThe company has established a systematic approach to measuring the impact of its tree planting initiatives, as evidenced by the documented emission absorption data for 2022-2024. The program is designed to create green open spaces within the company's area that serve multiple environmental functions while contributing directly to carbon sequestration. The company views this as a strategic and effective step in addressing climate change through both direct emission absorption and supporting global climate efforts, recognizing tree planting as an effective strategy for absorbing greenhouse gas emissions.",
      "notes": "Strategy focuses primarily on nature-based solutions through tree planting as the main decarbonization approach. The strategy includes specific implementation details with quantified results (number of trees planted and emission absorption). The company has a multi-year approach with documented data for 2022-2024. While energy efficiency programs are mentioned as part of the broader strategy, limited details about these programs are provided in the excerpt.",
