      "json": "[]",
      "notes": "No specific sustainability targets for 2024 with quantifiable metrics were found in the provided documents. The documents report actual 2024 emissions data (3,939,808.32 tonCO2e total GHG emissions) and carbon credit values (549,678.82 tonCO2e), but these are results, not targets. The company has established UT 2030 Sustainability Aspiration with targets to reduce GHG emissions by 30% and increase renewable energy proportion to 22% by 2030, but no specific 2024 targets were disclosed. The company initiated water conservation efforts in 2024, but this is not a quantifiable target metric. All reported sustainability targets are for future years (2030, 2050, 2060) rather than for 2024.",
      "status": null
